    "en:Domine os intervalos calculando saltos de distância (Uníssono, 2ª, 3ª, 4ª, 5ª, 6ª e 7ª).": "Master the intervals by calculating distance jumps (Unison, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, 5th, 6th and 7th).",
